    {"op": "note", "text": "Starts with the player out of Vault 101 (the given): Escape! (CG04) done at stage 200, whose script starts Following in His Footsteps (MQ01 stage 10) and Trouble on the Homefront (MS16). [observed: CG04 stage 200 script] Then The Guns of Anchorage done (the given, as ttw-dlc02oa2-the-guns-of-anchorage leaves it): the player is in the simulation's Command Tent at the U.S. field headquarters, General Chase has promoted the player (his line's end script: DLC02OA2 200, whose stage script starts this quest with objective 10, Listen to General Chase's briefing, and OA3Explain 1)."},
